{"pageProps":{"lesson":{"day":19,"title":"Day 19: Explaining a decision — SpeakSprint","heading":"Explaining a decision","kicker":"DAY 19 · 30 MINUTES · 6 SESSIONS / WEEK","description":"Giải thích quyết định và tiêu chí.","contentVersion":2,"answers":{"comp":"a|b|a","quiz":"a|b"},"sections":[{"id":"mission","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">MISSION · 1 MIN</span><h2>Today's mission</h2><p>Explain a work decision and the reason behind it. Speak for <b>120 seconds</b>, using at least <b>3 of today’s 5 chunks</b>. Say it first; write only brief notes.</p><p class=\"instruction\">5 chunk mỗi ngày · tối đa 5 chunk mới. Ngày tổng kết ôn lại chunk đã học.</p>"},{"id":"warmup","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Warm-up recall</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Recall before opening today’s chunk cards. Ôn theo mốc bài học +1, +3, +7, +14; mỗi lần chọn vài chunk để giữ bài gọn.</p><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 18 · ôn sau 1 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Compare one option with another. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Compared with our old tool, this one is easier to use.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 16 · ôn sau 3 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Support your point with a concrete example. <small>Use it in a different project or situation.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"For example, our daily meeting now takes fifteen minutes.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 12 · ôn sau 7 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Ask someone to demonstrate or show something. <small>Say two connected sentences aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Can you show me how to open the report?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 5 · ôn sau 14 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Name something that is stopping your progress. <small>Answer as if a colleague has just asked you.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"One blocker is that I don't have the test account.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"reading","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">We decided to launch a smaller version first. We chose this because we wanted customer feedback early. The reason was that we needed to learn before spending more time on extra features. We considered waiting for the full version, but that would take another month. Although the first version has fewer features, we can still solve the main customer problem. I think this is the better choice because it reduces risk. For example, we can test the new menu with real users this week. After that, we can decide which change will help them most.</div>"},{"id":"comprehension","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"comp","label":"COMPREHENSION · 3 MIN","heading":"Check the message","hint":"Look for who, what happened, and why the speaker says it.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. What decision did the team make?","choices":[{"text":" Launch a smaller version first","name":"comp-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp1"},{"text":" Wait for every feature","name":"comp-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp1"}]},{"prompt":"2. Why did they choose this?","choices":[{"text":" To stop talking to customers","name":"comp-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp2"},{"text":" To get feedback early","name":"comp-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp2"}]},{"prompt":"3. Why mention the new menu?","choices":[{"text":" To show how they can learn from users","name":"comp-3","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp3"},{"text":" To explain why the app is finished","name":"comp-3","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp3"}]}]},{"id":"chunks","className":"panel","type":"chunks","label":"CHUNKS · 5 MIN","heading":"Five chunks to use today","instruction":"Learn the whole phrase. Change the details to fit your work. Mở từng thẻ khi cần; sau đó nhìn đi chỗ khác và nói lại.","items":[{"label":"1/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"We decided to…","meaning":"Chúng tôi đã quyết định…","details":["Report a decision your team made.","We decided to + base verb","We decided to wait.","We decided to launch a smaller version."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-1"},{"label":"2/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"We chose this because…","meaning":"Chúng tôi chọn cách này vì…","details":["Explain why your team selected an option.","We chose this because + clause","We chose this because it's simpler.","We chose this because we need customer feedback soon."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-2"},{"label":"3/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"The reason was…","meaning":"Lý do là…","details":["Give the reason for a past decision.","The reason was + noun / that + clause","The reason was the cost.","The reason was that the team needed more time."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-3"},{"label":"4/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"We considered…","meaning":"Chúng tôi đã cân nhắc…","details":["Mention another option you discussed.","We considered + noun / verb-ing","We considered waiting.","We considered adding more features before launch."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-4"},{"label":"5/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"Although…, we…","meaning":"Mặc dù…, chúng tôi…","details":["Explain a decision that has a drawback.","Although + clause, we + clause","Although it costs more, we chose it.","Although the version is small, we can learn from users."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-5"}]},{"id":"variation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">VARIATION · 4 MIN</span><h2>Change it, then make it yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Say each answer first, then type a short sentence. Two quick variations per chunk; keep the same pattern.</p><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>1. We decided to…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\">A. Use this idea: test the main feature first.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>2. We chose this because…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\">A. Use this idea: it reduces the risk.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>3. The reason was…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\">A. Use this idea: the deadline was close.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>4. We considered…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\">A. Use this idea: change the design.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>5. Although…, we…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\">A. Use this idea: the team was busy / finished the test.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\"></div>"},{"id":"rapid-recall","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RAPID RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Recall in about three seconds</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Look away from the chunk cards. Try to start speaking within 3 seconds, then type what you said. A model appears only after an attempt; other natural answers are possible.</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Report a decision your team made. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We decided to launch a smaller version.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Explain why your team selected an option. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We chose this because we need customer feedback soon.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Give the reason for a past decision. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"The reason was that the team needed more time.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Mention another option you discussed. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We considered adding more features before launch.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Explain a decision that has a drawback. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Although the version is small, we can learn from users.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Compare a quality of two things. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Tool B is more secure than Tool A.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"speaking","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">SPEAK · 5 MIN</span><h2>Make the language yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read aloud three times. Follow the pauses marked by / and emphasize the important words.</p><div class=\"shadow\">We decided to wait. /<br>We chose this because it's simpler. /<br>The reason was the cost.</div><p><b>Speaking challenge:</b> Explain a work decision and the reason behind it.</p><p class=\"instruction\">Speak for 120 seconds. Use at least 3 chunks. Notes only: your situation · two details · a reason or problem · your next step. Do not write a full script first.</p><textarea id=\"speaking-response\" data-save=\"speaking\" placeholder=\"Nói thành tiếng trước, rồi nhập lại ít nhất 8 từ bạn đã nói…\"></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"speaking-done\">Tôi đã nói thành tiếng</button><span id=\"status-speaking\">Chưa hoàn thành</span></div><div id=\"speak-feedback\" class=\"feedback\"></div>"},{"id":"conversation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What would you recommend?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>Why do you prefer that option?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>Can you give me an example?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What concern should we consider?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"},{"id":"quiz","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"quiz","label":"END CHECK · 2 MIN","heading":"Choose a useful chunk","hint":"Think about the situation where you would use the phrase.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. Report a decision your team made.","choices":[{"text":" We decided to…","name":"quiz-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"},{"text":" We considered…","name":"quiz-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"}]},{"prompt":"2. Explain a decision that has a drawback.","choices":[{"text":" We chose this because…","name":"quiz-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"},{"text":" Although…, we…","name":"quiz-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"}]}]},{"id":"daily-progress","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">REVIEW · 2 MIN</span><h2>Today's progress</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Các số về nói và nhớ chunk là tự đánh giá; số câu đọc hiểu lấy từ lần nộp gần nhất. Chưa nhập nghĩa là chưa có dữ liệu.</p><p id=\"chunk-progress\" role=\"status\"></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-seconds\">Actual speaking time (seconds):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-improvement\">One thing I can do better now:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-improvement\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-improvement\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-next\">Tomorrow, one small thing I will practise:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-next\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-next\">"}],"completionText":"Hoàn thành đọc hiểu, kể lần một, quiz và các bước Recall → Think → đối chiếu → kể lần hai. Nhiều bài trong cùng ngày chỉ tính một ngày streak.","navigation":[{"href":"../index.html","text":"← Dashboard"},{"href":"day-20.html","text":"Day 20 →"}]},"pageType":"lesson"},"__N_SSG":true}